{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211101001:0":{"text":"신밧드, 왜 그래?","source_cn":"辛巴达，怎么不往前走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6478A3036D1330C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211101002:0":{"text":"안개가 너무 짙어... 아니면 조금 기다렸다가 다시 바다로 나가는 게 어때?","source_cn":"好浓的雾啊……要不，咱们还是晚点再出海吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB13B96823DC12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211101003:0":{"text":"러스트 항 근처의 짙은 안개에 비하면 이곳 날씨는 그리 나쁜 편이 아니야.","source_cn":"与锈锚港附近的浓雾相比，这里的天气不算恶劣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7259B85DCD58A685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211101004:0":{"text":"아, 알아... 내 말은 여기까지 왔으니, 돌다리도 두드려보고 건너자는 말이지.","source_cn":"我、我知道……但我的意思是，都到这一步了，小心驶得万年船嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0E6EBC2A399F80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211101005:0":{"text":"왜, 무서워?","source_cn":"你害怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C39BB52794D29C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211101006:0":{"text":"아니거든.","source_cn":"我可没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EFF3C4A87FCE4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211101007:0":{"text":"그런데 손은 떨고 있네?","source_cn":"可你的手在发抖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C270B1C24429FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211101008:0":{"text":"이게 무서워? 신밧드 겁쟁이네!","source_cn":"这都怕？辛巴达是胆小鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0890EFD8AB86E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211101009:0":{"text":"신밧드, 네가 키를 잡아. 내가 조수 역할을 할게.","source_cn":"辛巴达，你来掌舵，我给你当副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB0EC12CC3F533A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211101010:0":{"text":"네가 조수 역할을 하겠다고?","source_cn":"你要当副手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4DB32BA824C780E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211101011:0":{"text":"그래. 항해 중에 적을 만나면 내가 해결할 테니까.","source_cn":"是啊，如果航行中遇到了敌人，我来应付。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C21C7FE7B2C98B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211101012:0":{"text":"네가 선뜻 조수를 하겠다고 말하다니... 의외인걸?","source_cn":"我的意思是……你竟然愿意给我当副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F82658DB72F2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211101013:0":{"text":"오해하지 마. 그냥 네 선장 놀이에 맞춰주려고 했던 것뿐이니까.","source_cn":"别想太多了。我只是心血来潮，想陪你玩玩扮演船长的游戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11A7230E75F20F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211101014:0":{"text":"오는 내내 꽤 선장다운 모습을 보였잖아?","source_cn":"这一路上，你不是很有船长的风范吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1CB8A8E6FEDC0C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211101015:0":{"text":"선장이라... 내가 정말 선장이 될 수 있을까?","source_cn":"船长……我真的能当船长吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46AA2256A4F26AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1211101015":{"text":"선장이라... 내가 정말 선장이 될 수 있을까?","source_cn":"船长……我真的能当船长吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46AA2256A4F26AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211101016:0":{"text":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","source_cn":"是吗，既然你都这么说了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x013BD273600461E6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","female":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","variant_male_record_index":"129948","variant_female_record_index":"129949","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211101019:0":{"text":"좋아... 난 준비 됐어.","source_cn":"好……我准备好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF20955038160874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211101020:0":{"text":"선원들이여! 지금부터 이 신밧드 선장의 호령을 들으라!","source_cn":"水手们！从现在起，要听辛巴达船长的号令！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE131DD9AC766D259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211101021:0":{"text":"짙은 안개를 뚫고! 보물이 있는 곳으로 간다!","source_cn":"我们要冲破迷雾！抵达宝藏的所在！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CE1CE3814F145A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"넌 좋은 선장이 될 거야","source_cn":"你能当好船长","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4761354B77F2D020","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"넌 좋은 선장이 될 거야","female":"넌 좋은 선장이 될 거야","variant_male_record_index":"65448","variant_female_record_index":"65449","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211101017:0":{"text":"그래... 알아. 진정한 선장에 비하면 난 아직 멀었지.","source_cn":"是啊……我知道，和一位真正的船长相比，我还差得远呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8806F863CE1FCC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래... 알아. 진정한 선장에 비하면 난 아직 멀었지.","female":"그래... 알아. 진정한 선장에 비하면 난 아직 멀었지.","variant_male_record_index":"129950","variant_female_record_index":"129951","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211101018:0":{"text":"게다가 내가 계속 주저한다면...","source_cn":"所以，如果我迟迟不能迈出第一步的话——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1A63E32BF2F98784","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 내가 계속 주저한다면...","female":"게다가 내가 계속 주저한다면...","variant_male_record_index":"129952","variant_female_record_index":"129953","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"넌 더 성장해야 해","source_cn":"你还需要成长","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7498FBF8E66A2B2E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"넌 더 성장해야 해","female":"넌 더 성장해야 해","variant_male_record_index":"65450","variant_female_record_index":"65451","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}